{
  "script_id": "platonic-solids",
  "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
  "voice_key": "yunxi",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "platonic-solids",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/platonic-solids/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.99,
      "size": 47808,
      "text": "正多面体要求很严格：每个面都是同样的正多边形，每个顶点又要连出同样数目的面。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "platonic-solids",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/platonic-solids/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.88,
      "size": 62064,
      "text": "平面上正多边形有无穷多种，三角形四边形五边形一直数下去。那么空间里的正多面体有多少种？"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "platonic-solids",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/platonic-solids/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.09,
      "size": 65520,
      "text": "答案是恰好五种，一个不多一个不少。欧几里得在《几何原本》最后一卷证明了这件事，是数学史上最早的分类定理之一。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "platonic-solids",
      "section_id": "why",
      "line_id": "wy-1",
      "filename": "why-wy-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/platonic-solids/why-wy-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.72,
      "size": 59472,
      "text": "证明思路出人意料地简单。看一个顶点：若有 p 个正 q 边形聚在这里，它们的内角之和必须小于三百六十度。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "platonic-solids",
      "section_id": "why",
      "line_id": "wy-2",
      "filename": "why-wy-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/platonic-solids/why-wy-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.52,
      "size": 72288,
      "text": "等于三百六十度就摊平成了平面，超过就围不起来。代入正多边形内角公式，化简后得到一个漂亮的条件：p 减二乘 q 减二小于四。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "platonic-solids",
      "section_id": "why",
      "line_id": "wy-3",
      "filename": "why-wy-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/platonic-solids/why-wy-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.8,
      "size": 60768,
      "text": "现在只需枚举正整数解。屏幕上列出了全部解，恰好五组，对应五种立体。这个不等式就是全部答案。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "platonic-solids",
      "section_id": "euler",
      "line_id": "el-1",
      "filename": "euler-el-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/platonic-solids/euler-el-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.26,
      "size": 52128,
      "text": "怎么确认数据没抄错？用欧拉公式：顶点数减棱数加面数，对凸多面体恒等于二。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "platonic-solids",
      "section_id": "euler",
      "line_id": "el-2",
      "filename": "euler-el-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/platonic-solids/euler-el-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.76,
      "size": 44208,
      "text": "这个数叫欧拉特征数，它是拓扑不变量，跟形状怎么变都无关，只跟有几个洞有关。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "platonic-solids",
      "section_id": "euler",
      "line_id": "el-3",
      "filename": "euler-el-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/platonic-solids/euler-el-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.67,
      "size": 74736,
      "text": "五种立体逐个验算：四面体四减六加四，六面体八减十二加六，都等于二。棱数是从面表自动推出来的，不手工列举，避免抄错。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "platonic-solids",
      "section_id": "dual",
      "line_id": "dl-1",
      "filename": "dual-dl-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/platonic-solids/dual-dl-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.87,
      "size": 45936,
      "text": "把每个面的中心取出来当新顶点，相邻面的中心连起来当新棱，得到的立体叫对偶多面体。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "platonic-solids",
      "section_id": "dual",
      "line_id": "dl-2",
      "filename": "dual-dl-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/platonic-solids/dual-dl-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.89,
      "size": 62208,
      "text": "对偶会交换顶点数与面数，棱数不变。六面体八个顶点六个面，对偶后成了六个顶点八个面，正是正八面体。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "platonic-solids",
      "section_id": "defect",
      "line_id": "df-1",
      "filename": "defect-df-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/platonic-solids/defect-df-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.09,
      "size": 49392,
      "text": "还有一条漂亮定理。每个顶点处，三百六十度减去聚集的内角和，差额叫角亏。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "platonic-solids",
      "section_id": "defect",
      "line_id": "df-2",
      "filename": "defect-df-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/platonic-solids/defect-df-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.85,
      "size": 45648,
      "text": "笛卡尔发现：把所有顶点的角亏加起来，无论哪种凸多面体，总和恒为七百二十度。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "platonic-solids",
      "section_id": "defect",
      "line_id": "df-3",
      "filename": "defect-df-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/platonic-solids/defect-df-3.mp3",
      "duration": 5.22,
      "size": 83520,
      "text": "请切换五种立体验证。四面体每个顶点角亏一百八十度，四个顶点合计七百二十。二十面体每个顶点只有六十度，但有十二个，同样是七百二十。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "platonic-solids",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/platonic-solids/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.88,
      "size": 46080,
      "text": "第一，正多面体恰好五种，由顶点角条件 p 减二乘 q 减二小于四完全决定。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "platonic-solids",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/platonic-solids/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.61,
      "size": 41760,
      "text": "第二，欧拉公式顶点减棱加面等于二，是检验多面体数据的最强判据。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "platonic-solids",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/platonic-solids/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.98,
      "size": 47664,
      "text": "第三，对偶交换顶点与面，角亏总和恒为七百二十度。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "platonic-solids",
      "section_id": "dual",
      "line_id": "dl-3",
      "filename": "dual-dl-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/platonic-solids/dual-dl-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.4,
      "size": 54432,
      "text": "十二面体与二十面体也是这样一对。四面体最特别，它的对偶还是四面体，叫自对偶。"
    }
  ],
